{"n":71,"name":"Nuh","nameAr":"نوح","meaning":"Noah","ayahs":28,"place":"makkah","bismillah":true,"ayat":[{"n":1,"juz":29,"ar":"إِنَّآ أَرْسَلْنَا نُوحًا إِلَىٰ قَوْمِهِۦٓ أَنْ أَنذِرْ قَوْمَكَ مِن قَبْلِ أَن يَأْتِيَهُمْ عَذَابٌ أَلِيمٌ","en":"Indeed, We sent Noah to his people, [saying], \"Warn your people before there comes to them a painful punishment.\"","w":[{"ar":"إِنَّآ","tr":"innā","en":"Indeed, We"},{"ar":"أَرْسَلْنَا","tr":"arsalnā","en":"[We] sent","root":"رسل","lem":"أَرْسَلَ"},{"ar":"نُوحًا","tr":"nūḥan","en":"Nuh"},{"ar":"إِلَىٰ","tr":"ilā","en":"to"},{"ar":"قَوْمِهِۦٓ","tr":"qawmihi","en":"his people","root":"قوم","lem":"قَوْم"},{"ar":"أَنْ","tr":"an","en":"that"},{"ar":"أَنذِرْ","tr":"andhir","en":"Warn","root":"نذر","lem":"أَنذَرَ"},{"ar":"قَوْمَكَ","tr":"qawmaka","en":"your people","root":"قوم","lem":"قَوْم"},{"ar":"مِن","tr":"min","en":"from"},{"ar":"قَبْلِ","tr":"qabli","en":"before","root":"قبل","lem":"قَبْل"},{"ar":"أَن","tr":"an","en":"[that]"},{"ar":"يَأْتِيَهُمْ","tr":"yatiyahum","en":"comes to them","root":"أتي","lem":"أَتَى"},{"ar":"عَذَابٌ","tr":"ʿadhābun","en":"a punishment","root":"عذب","lem":"عَذاب"},{"ar":"أَلِيمٌۭ","tr":"alīmun","en":"painful","root":"ألم","lem":"أَلِيم"}]},{"n":2,"juz":29,"ar":"قَالَ يَـٰقَوْمِ إِنِّى لَكُمْ نَذِيرٌ مُّبِينٌ","en":"He said, \"O my people, indeed I am to you a clear warner -","w":[{"ar":"قَالَ","tr":"qāla","en":"He said","root":"قول","lem":"قالَ"},{"ar":"يَـٰقَوْمِ","tr":"yāqawmi","en":"O my people","root":"قوم","lem":"قَوْم"},{"ar":"إِنِّى","tr":"innī","en":"Indeed, I am"},{"ar":"لَكُمْ","tr":"lakum","en":"to you"},{"ar":"نَذِيرٌۭ","tr":"nadhīrun","en":"a warner","root":"نذر","lem":"نَذِير"},{"ar":"مُّبِينٌ","tr":"mubīnun","en":"clear","root":"بين","lem":"مُبِين"}]},{"n":3,"juz":29,"ar":"أَنِ ٱعْبُدُوا۟ ٱللَّهَ وَٱتَّقُوهُ وَأَطِيعُونِ","en":"To worship Allāh, fear Him and obey me.","w":[{"ar":"أَنِ","tr":"ani","en":"That"},{"ar":"ٱعْبُدُوا۟","tr":"uʿ'budū","en":"Worship","root":"عبد","lem":"عَبَ